{{~##
Photo Figure Template - Lumina Theme

Renders a [[photo: path]] block from Markdown: one photo at full content width,
linked to its photo page. The picture markup is the shared ContentImage partial.

Context variables:
- image: ImageData { id, slug, width, height, title?, description?, sizes, placeholder? }
- viewer_mode: 'page' (link to the photo page) or 'none' (theme renders no photo pages)
- context_id: page context for the photo page's return link, or null for `| gallery`
  (the photo page then uses its primary context, normally the photo's gallery)
- occurrence_id: anchor id the photo page's return link targets
- assets_basepath: Path/URL to image folder
- basepath: Relative path to root
- image_formats: Available formats ["avif", "webp", "jpg"]
##~}}
{{~ if !image.sizes || image.sizes.size == 0; ret; end ~}}
{{~ alt = image.title && image.title != '' ? image.title : (image.description && image.description != '' ? image.description : (t 'photo.label' image.id)) ~}}
{{~ classes = [] ~}}
{{~ photo_href = null ~}}
{{~ if viewer_mode == 'page' ~}}
{{~ photo_href = page_url(image) ~}}
{{~ if context_id; photo_href = photo_href + '#ctx-' + context_id; end ~}}
{{~ end ~}}
<figure class="photo-figure" id="{{ html_escape occurrence_id }}">
{{~ if photo_href ~}}
  <a href="{{ html_escape photo_href }}">
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ include 'contentimage' ~}}
{{~ if photo_href ~}}
  </a>
{{~ end ~}}
</figure>
